<title>USA: Koo Koo Roo names Robert Kautz president.</title>
<headline>Koo Koo Roo names Robert Kautz president.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koo Koo Roo Inc said Tuesday it had named Robert Kautz president.</p>
<p>He will continue to serve as chief financial officer, a post he has held since November 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>Kautz's predecessor as president was not named.</p>
</text>
